{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Mercury Retrograde"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Computer Troubles"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Exchange information about hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">That</span> Clauses as the Subject or Object"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You usually use <span class=\"italic\">that-</span>clauses to talk about facts or beliefs. <br/> <span class=\"italic\">That-</span>clauses can be places in different parts of the sentence, depending on what you want to communicate."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">That-</span>clauses can be the <span class=\"underline\">subject </span>of the sentence. You normally use this structure in formal writing or speaking."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">That we don't care </span>is simply not true.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "It is more common to use the structure <span class=\"italic\">It ... that ...</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": " For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">It </span>is simply not true <span class=\"strong\">that we don't care</span>.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you use a that-clause as the <span class=\"underline\">object </span> (after reporting verbs), you often omit <span class=\"italic\">that</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">She promised <span class=\"strong\">(that) she would come.</span></span> "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I just got the text (that) you sent yesterday."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I got it at the exact same time (that) you sent it yesterday,"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I think (that) there's something wrong with my phone."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I showed him the text (that) I had received. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Asking for and Offering Help With Technical Problems"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " There are many ways to ask for and offer help in English. Some are more formal than others."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Asking for Help\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Offering for Help\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Examples\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could you do me a favor? <br/> Could I ask you a favor? <br/>  Can I ask you to ... <br/> I need some help (if you have time). <br/> (If you're not busy) I could use your help.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">May I help you? <br/> Can I help you? <br/> Are you looking for something? <br/> Would you like some help? <br/> Do you need some help? <br/> What can I do for you today?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>Do you need some help with your laptop?</li> <li>I wonder if you could do me a favor.</li> <li>What can I do?</li> <li>Can I ask you to send me an e-mail?</li> <li>Tell me how I can help.</li> </ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "odd"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "strange or unexpected"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have received some odd e-mails from you. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob02aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about strange events and coincidences."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to back up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to copy information to a separate location in case the original copy is lost or damaged"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(phrasal verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Have you backed up your phone?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob02aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "glitch"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a problem or fault"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There's some sort of glitch."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob02aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bizarre"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "strange and unusual"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Isn't that bizarre?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob02aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "mortifying"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very embarrassing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Oh, this is mortifying."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob02aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "precisely"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "exactly accurate"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I got it at precisely the same time that you sent it yesterday."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob02aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le17ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "On a piece of paper, write down five possible things that could go wrong with different types of technology."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Get together with a partner and show him or her your list."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Together, talk about some ways to solve each of your technological problems."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Do the same with your partner's list of technological problems."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I make a list of technological problems."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I discuss solutions to technological problems with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make suggestions and give advice. "}]}], "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le17ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le17ob02re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le17ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hello?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span> : Hi Peter. Guess what? I just got the text that you sent yesterday. Isn't that bizarre?\nAnd I got it at precisely the same time that you sent it yesterday, but a day later.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span> : Hmmm. That is weird. I think there's something wrong with my phone. I received a text this morning from a friend, asking me to come to his house at 9:00 a.m. I went to his house and he answered the door in his pyjamas. I showed him the text that I had received. He started laughing and said that he sent that text a month ago. I just received it today! He said he was wondering why I never showed up at his place.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le17ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh Peter. Have you backed up your phone? Maybe it's time for a new one.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span> : And a new computer.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span> : What do you mean? Do you need some help with your laptop?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span> : Yes, that's why I'm calling. I wonder if you could do me a favor.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span> : Sure. What can I do?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span> : Can I ask you to send me an e-mail? Every time I try to reply to an e-mail the reply goes to a different person. There's some sort of glitch.", "id": 2, "time": "37000", "image": "engenn10le17ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Actually, now that you mention it, I have received some odd e-mails from you. I was wondering why you were sending me an e-mail asking if I knew any single women that I could introduce you to.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span> : Yeah, that's because they weren't for you. Oh, this is mortifying. That e-mails I wrote to one friend are going to another is very worrying.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span> : Okay, well tell me how I can help. Let's do a test and we'll try to figure this out.", "id": 3, "time": "63000", "image": "engenn10le17ob02re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can discuss coincidences and strange events."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can express opinions and beliefs. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can ask and offer help with technical problems."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What kinds of problems have you had with your computer?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " Who do you ask for help when you have computer problems?"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content